206	// ---- the run-history terms (precondition-policy.mjs BUILTIN_TERMS) -----------
207	// Judged over `runs` — this task's own unqualified items, newest first, the item
208	// under evaluation excluded — and the item's facts. A person's wake stands in
209	// for the cadence: `due:` and `last-run-over:` hold on a woken item, and ONLY
210	// those two — `last-run-not-failed` reads the newest run whatever woke this one.
