445	// list is not (S6/F11): a mark this list misses is a request that silently waits an
446	// hour, and one it misses TWICE is a request nobody notices was never picked up.
447	//
448	// The author's push permission comes back with each issue, because adoption gates
449	// the body's parameters on it (PRINCIPLES.md) and the payload's `author_association` is not
450	// that fact: `MEMBER` is any org member whatever their repo permission, and
451	// `COLLABORATOR` includes read-only collaborators (F30). A read that cannot answer
452	// leaves the flag `null`, which gates the parameters off — the safe end of a field
453	// that chooses a task, a model, or the right to land a change without review.
