407	      // next day against a cause nobody had fixed. That is how ClaudiniteCanary
408	      // reached seven copies of one fleet-digest failure and hitbut twenty-two.
409	      //
410	      // The verdict is not discarded — it was always most useful as the human-facing
411	      // instruction, and that is where it now goes, kind and detail both. A run that
